  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">QuantaPep v4.0 shows early signs of reach and reuse for a preprint-style research output: it has 11 recorded downloads, 163 views, and one documented downstream reuse linked to an associated article. The citation record is still at zero, so the current picture is one of initial uptake rather than established scholarly influence.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">QuantaPep v4.0 presents an autonomous, genotype-aware approach to peptide discovery, framed around scalability, machine learning, computational biology, and drug discovery. The work is openly available on Zenodo and authored by Adam Werderits, with Stevenage Bioscience Catalyst listed in the contributor record. Its abstract positions the platform as a closed-loop system that combines sequence design, structural validation, and manufacturing-aware optimization for use across diverse human genetic backgrounds.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">The clearest impact signals are modest but concrete. DataCite reports 163 views and 11 downloads, indicating that the record has been consulted and retrieved, even if at an early stage. OpenAlex currently shows no citations, so the scholarly citation footprint has not yet developed. In that setting, the usage data are best read as evidence of initial attention rather than downstream academic consolidation.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">There is also one documented reuse event in the record, listed as an associated article. That is important because it shows the work is not only being seen but is connected to subsequent research output. The reuse signal is narrow, however, and the available record does not yet show a broader citation network or sustained public discussion.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Overall, QuantaPep v4.0 appears to be an early-stage research contribution with a technically ambitious scope and a small but visible uptake profile. The evidence points to limited but real engagement: some readership, a documented reuse, and open availability through a trusted repository. At this point, the record supports a cautious narrative of emerging interest rather than mature impact.</p>",
